      "imagen": "img/01_portada.png", "subtitulos": false, "movimiento": false,
      "texto_narrado": "The way most people check if a jar sealed — listen for the pop and call it done — is the reason half their pantry doesn't make it to spring.",
      "drive_id": "1Tqhuaai9XzayLzk_FBYdxpdfHWTcTcgr" },
    { "n": 2, "layout": "full_bleed", "asset": "STOCK-hand-holding-jar-blank-tag_9x16_v1.png",
      "drive_id": "1oJhBFJO-fegDNCeKP0D1mO0c4EVykxzd",
      "imagen": "img/02_habito.png",
      "texto_narrado": "I used to do the same thing. Hear the pop, stack the jar, move on." },
    { "n": 3, "layout": "full_bleed", "asset": "STOCK-jar-lid-closeup-flex_9x16_v1.jpg",
      "drive_id": "1Q3IjprDcG8wXc0b7ejvNP-kbkdR0f4Mh",
      "imagen": "img/03_problema.png",
      "texto_narrado": "Turns out a pop just means pressure released. It doesn't mean the seal actually held." },
    { "n": 4, "layout": "full_bleed", "asset": "STOCK-hand-holding-jar-blank-tag_9x16_v1.png",
      "drive_id": "1oJhBFJO-fegDNCeKP0D1mO0c4EVykxzd",
      "imagen": "img/04_test.png",
      "texto_narrado": "The real test: press the center of the lid. If it flexes *at all*, it's not sealed — no matter what you heard." },
    { "n": 5, "layout": "full_bleed", "asset": "FYR_B12_pantry-shelf-jars_9x16_v1.png",
      "drive_id": "13FUqw7670pWmMyzJVkWXEz0DyDKE8ZLK",
      "imagen": "img/05_resultado.png",
      "texto_narrado": "My first jar that passed that test, for real, sat on this shelf for six months. Untouched. Unspoiled." },
    { "n": 6, "layout": "full_bleed", "asset": "STOCK-jar-harvest-2023_9x16_v1.png",
